# --- local snapshots: kept on disk, never shipped ---
#
# Point-in-time copies of the whole project. Useful locally and actively
# harmful in a repository: they triple the file count, and anyone reading
# the code (or grepping it) hits three stale copies of every module.
_backup_*/
design/
